-    attachable.variant :large, resize_to_limit: [ 1500, 1500 ], format: :webp, process: :later
+    # format must be a string. Reader URLs JSON-encode transformations, which
+    # turns a symbol into a string. A symbol here would not match the variant
+    # the background job records, so the first view would convert the image
